    <h1>Free Meta Description Checker: Length, Width and Snippet Preview</h1>
    <p>Paste a title and meta description and this <strong>meta description checker</strong> counts the characters, estimates the pixel width, shows how the snippet may look on desktop and mobile, and checks your target keyword. A bulk mode checks a whole list. No signup, nothing leaves your browser.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .mdc-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap:10px; margin:0 0 14px; }
  .mdc-stat { background:#fff; border:1px solid #EAE0D2; border-radius:12px; padding:12px 14px; }
  .mdc-stat b { display:block; font-size:1.5rem; line-height:1.1; }
  .mdc-stat span { font-size:.8rem; color:#6b6459; }
  .mdc-good { color:#0B807C; } .mdc-warn { color:#B5730E; } .mdc-bad { color:#C23B3F; }
  .mdc-checks { list-style:none; margin:0 0 14px; padding:0; display:grid; gap:6px; }
  .mdc-checks li { font-size:.92rem; padding:8px 12px; border-radius:10px; background:#fff; border:1px solid #EAE0D2; }
  .mdc-checks li.ok { border-left:4px solid #0EA5A0; } .mdc-checks li.warn { border-left:4px solid #F5A623; } .mdc-checks li.bad { border-left:4px solid #E5484D; }
  .mdc-serp { background:#fff; border:1px solid #EAE0D2; border-radius:12px; padding:16px 18px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }
  .mdc-serp.mobile { max-width:360px; }
  .mdc-serp .u { font-size:12px; color:#4d5156; margin-bottom:2px; word-break:break-all; }
  .mdc-serp .t { font-size:20px; line-height:1.3; color:#1a0dab; margin:0 0 3px; }
  .mdc-serp .d { font-size:14px; line-height:1.58; color:#4d5156; }
  .mdc-tabs { display:flex; gap:8px; margin:0 0 10px; }
  .mdc-tabs button { cursor:pointer; }
  .mdc-bulk table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:.88rem; }
  .mdc-bulk th, .mdc-bulk td { text-align:left; padding:7px 8px; border-bottom:1px solid #EAE0D2; vertical-align:top; }
  .mdc-bulk td.txt { max-width:340px; word-break:break-word; }
</style>

