          <input type="text" id="mdc-title" placeholder="Meta Description Length: What Google Says vs 8 Guides"></div>
        <div><label for="mdc-desc">Meta description</label>
          <textarea id="mdc-desc" rows="5" placeholder="Learn how long a meta description should be, what Google cuts off and how to write one that fits.">Learn how long a meta description should be, what Google cuts off and how to write one that fits. Based on 8 guides and 363 of our own posts.</textarea></div>
        <div><label for="mdc-url">Page URL (optional, for the preview)</label>
          <input type="text" id="mdc-url" placeholder="https://example.com/blog/meta-description-length"></div>
        <div><label for="mdc-kw">Target keyword (optional)</label>
          <input type="text" id="mdc-kw" placeholder="meta description length"></div>
      </form>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-info-card llms-preview-card">
